                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f71e2651-64f1-42cd-a2e0-d9bfd8c18098",
                                                "sense_id": "f8746a41-f735-3445-bde5-b2da1785c191",
                                                "text": "If you dig deeper into the criminal engagings of Hillary Clinton, you might perhaps end up at the Clinton Foundation. Look at what the Clinton foundation actually does with its money (or doesn't do) or even worse, who has donated large sums of money."
